  "content": "<p data-pid=\"3rl3oNh9\">正常，上次逛广橘的时候还看到有高中生没有手机，用现金买百合同人作品，我还以为我穿越了。</p><p data-pid=\"iskvgsT3\">另外日本那边百合作品都是直接在书店里面摆出来卖的：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d47cb28e7832da1964b0ac15ed9964b4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"5712\" data-rawheight=\"4284\" data-size=\"normal\" data-original-token=\"v2-d47cb28e7832da1964b0ac15ed9964b4\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"5712\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d47cb28e7832da1964b0ac15ed9964b4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;5712&#39; height=&#39;4284&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"5712\" data-rawheight=\"4284\" data-size=\"normal\" data-original-token=\"v2-d47cb28e7832da1964b0ac15ed9964b4\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"5712\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d47cb28e7832da1964b0ac15ed9964b4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d47cb28e7832da1964b0ac15ed9964b4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-727866caee072ffe5fb5648550eb4083_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-rawwidth=\"5712\" data-rawheight=\"4284\" data-size=\"normal\" data-original-token=\"v2-727866caee072ffe5fb5648550eb4083\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"5712\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-727866caee072ffe5fb5648550eb4083_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;5712&#39; height=&#39;4284&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-rawwidth=\"5712\" data-rawheight=\"4284\" data-size=\"normal\" data-original-token=\"v2-727866caee072ffe5fb5648550eb4083\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"5712\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-727866caee072ffe5fb